Package: ha-desktop-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Maintainer: ha-desktop-agent maintainers
Description: Desktop telemetry agent for Home Assistant
 User-session agent that publishes one MQTT Discovery device to Home Assistant.
 Does not enable the systemd user unit; copy the example config and enable it
 yourself.
